  "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nI would like to use Matrix to manage a Hotline. But with the current permission model, this is not possible to guarantee privacy for users requesting help.\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nA single room where all support staff and clients can write messages.\r\nBut a client can only see his own messages and the answers from support staff (in a Thread, meaning a message is handled like a ticket where staff and client can exchange on the same topic).\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nA single room where everybody can see the messages from others, but for obvious privacy reasons, it is not possible.\r\nOr every users can start a direct chat with a member of the staff, but the staff will be quickly overwhelmed.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nSetting up Matrix for a large organization, I wanted to provide support for the users through Matrix.\r\n",
